{"title":"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following integers is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7de59ace307fb3f508979372b19972a508aee7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"418\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a> to find how far the numbers are from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and then choose the integer that resulted in the smallest absolute value:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e34354613c59fc29015d6ef93d3e41426d9e503.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-1| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab85fb329a068ee1393e0e129acbbf188980101.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|2| = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16485390a90172e4d4316de54d8d6955ffd594e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-3| = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2634cba4924173b79a4fd797104552c242391ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4| = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f925ea7ec46d1f253ffd3e0157a6c4dd59e6134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-5| = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We then see that the closest integer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff87c0543ede0692d31cc11ad5296240de7402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } -1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ordering the numbers from least to greatest (including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />), we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63eb4d36d95bb19cccf513cf81de60183e1676f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5, -3, -1, 0, 2, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>We then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would be the two closest numbers to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff87c0543ede0692d31cc11ad5296240de7402.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } -1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" /> is the closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b>